# Local strict v1 release-evidence file. The v0.0 release evidence registry
# (docs/release-evidence.json, schema release-evidence-v1) is a tracked public-
# safe record of the v0.0 tag and must NOT be ignored. The v1 strict release
# evidence file lives outside public Git per the completion gate in docs/goal.md
# and the Release Evidence Validation section in docs/v1-readiness-checklist.md;
# a future local filename would conventionally be docs/release-evidence.v1.json
# (or similar) and is ignored here as a guardrail.
docs/release-evidence.v1.json
